{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hit and Stand Blackjack</strong> is a relaxed 2D card game where you play classic blackjack at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No timers, no pressure \u2014 just sit back, play your hand, and enjoy the calm atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only sound in the game is a gentle <strong>background music track</strong>, designed to help you relax. Prefer silence? You can easily adjust or disable the music in the settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic solo blackjack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over/Under side bet: Guess if your starting hand totals over or under 13 for bonus credits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split pairs for more chances to win</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple difficulty levels \u2014 from casual to challenging (note: on Hard mode the player\u2019s hand count is hidden)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five unlockable achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing background music only</strong> (no sound effects)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple included backgrounds to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizable audio and language settings</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're unwinding after a long day or looking for a chill card game, <i>Hit and Stand Blackjack</i> is your perfect match.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Win!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3460100/af4ca9beffb1752b455526c75771ac21c2fa5ec3.jpg"},{"name":"Rich Player","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3460100/2b67cd7065d4da5a2bcb78ffc2885a037071c54f.jpg"},{"name":"One Hour","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3460100/190e12a9f8dc4499fe608c20a4a0d07e5513259e.jpg"}